        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ops-note" value="&lt;b&gt;Reliability flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Domain transaction writes booking change + outbox event atomically.&lt;br&gt;2. Worker claims outbox rows with a short lease and SKIP LOCKED.&lt;br&gt;3. Email delivery uniqueness prevents logical duplicate sends.&lt;br&gt;4. Worker Thread generates XLSX only; queue worker performs DB/network I/O.&lt;br&gt;5. schedule_runs guarantees one cron execution per logical period." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="o1">
